the H2 vs H1 and aftershock tests are larger.", "observed_verdict": "supported"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:insufficient_exposure"}, {"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:small_sample"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:EXPOSURE_SPARSITY"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER"}, {"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-APPA-050"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-055", "label": "Study family SF-APPA-055: All play types x Q1-Q4 gradient on 30 stars", "score": 0.766, "reached_via": ["FAM:SF-APPA-050 auto_related_family (record_link_extends) FAM:SF-APPA-055", "request matches DS:NBA_play_by_play_possessions_and_reconstructed_lineups (0.73); FAM:SF-APPA-055 auto_uses_dataset DS:NBA_play_by_play_possessions_and_reconstructed_lineups"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "All play types x Q1-Q4 gradient on 30 stars", "auto_outcome_status": "supported", "observed_hypothesis": "Only PUTBACK shows a fatigue signature (near-zero Q1 suppression compounding to Q4) across the full 30-star panel.", "observed_result": "PUTBACK Q1 d=-0.001 to Q4 d=-0.233, Q1->Q4 -0.232 (Q1 poss 722 / Q4 531). Other PTs suppress in Q1 already; largest other gradient DRIVE -0.060. CUT reverses +0.020. TRANSITION -0.053.", "auto_failure_mechanism": "D_positive (no failure: positive result)", "observed_failure_evidence": "On the full 30-star weighted panel, only PUTBACK is near-zero in Q1 and heavy in Q4.", "observed_sample_and_power": "30 stars; PUTBACK Q4 n=531 poss", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED", "observed_verdict": "supported"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:MECHANICAL_FLOOR"}, {"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-APPA-050"}, {"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-APPA-054"}, {"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-APPA-056"}]}], "n_results": 10}

